      <TableCell>baselineCapabilitySet selects an initial set of optional capabilities to enable, which can be extended via additionalEnabledCapabilities.  If unset, the cluster will choose a default, and the default may change over time. The current default is vCurrent.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
