      <h3 id="_statusconditions" class="group scroll-mt-20">.status.conditions<a href="#_statusconditions" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>conditions provides information about the cluster version. The condition "Available" is set to true if the desiredUpdate has been reached. The condition "Progressing" is set to true if an update is being applied. The condition "Degraded" is set to true if an update is currently blocked by a temporary or permanent error. Conditions are only valid for the current desiredUpdate when metadata.generation is equal to status.generation.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`array`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      </dl>
