      <h3 id="_statusdesired" class="group scroll-mt-20">.status.desired<a href="#_statusdesired" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>desired is the version that the cluster is reconciling towards. If the cluster is not yet fully initialized desired will be set with the information available, which may be an image or a tag.</p></dd>
